@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+# Knowledge boundary rollback
+
+The delivery path now depends on `Knowledge::Catalog.list(tenant_id:)`, while
+`Knowledge::Document` and the other persistence-backed services remain private
+to the Knowledge pack. No tables, records, or persistence representation were
+changed as part of this extraction.
+
+If this boundary must be rolled back, restore the delivery implementation to
+render the same four fields from the existing published-document query, remove
+the root dependency on `packs/knowledge`, and move the Knowledge-owned files
+back to their original `app/models/knowledge` and `app/services/knowledge`
+locations. Re-run the characterization and endpoint tests before considering a
+later persistence change. Do not roll back by changing the `documents` table
+or rewriting existing records.
